{
  "title": "Ziyarat-e-Hazrat Imam Reza (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا مَوْلَایَ وَ ابْنَ مَوْلَایَ. \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAWLAAYA WABNA MAWLAAYA. \nPeace be upon you, my master and son of my master. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا غَرِیْبَ الْغُرَبَاءِ. \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA GHAREEBAL GHORABAA. \nPeace be upon you, stranger of strangers. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا سُلْطَانَ اَبَا الْحَسَنِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SULTAAN ABAL HASAN \nPeace be upon you, O Sultan Abal Hasan \nعَلِیِّ ابْنِ مُوْسَی الرِّضَا\nA’LI YABNA MOOSAR REZAA \nAli ibn Moosa al-Reza,\nوَ رَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَ بَرَكَاتَهٗ.\nWA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOH. \nand the mercy and blessings of Allah.\nAnother Ziyarat of Hazrat Imam Reza (a.s.)\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا غَرِيْبَ الْغُرَبَاۤءِ،\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA GHAREEBAL GHORABAA. \nPeace be upon you, O stranger among strangers.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُعِيْنَ الضُّعَفَاۤءِ وَالْفُقَرَاۤءِ،\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MOE’ENAZ ZO-A’FAAA-E WAL FOQARAAA-E. \nPeace be upon you, O Helper of the weak and the poor.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُغِيْثَ الشِّيْعَةِ وَالزُّوَّارِ فِيْ يَوْمِ الْجَزَاۤءِ،\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MOGHEESASH SHEE-A’TE WAZ ZUWWAARE FEE YAWMIL JAZAAA-E. \nPeace be upon you, O Rescuer/Succor of the Shia and the pilgrims (visitors) on the Day of Recompense (Judgment).\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَاۤ اَنِيْسَ النُّفُوْسِ،\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ANEESAN NOFOOSE. \nPeace be upon you, O solace of souls.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْمَدْفُوْنُ بِاَرْضِ طُوْسِ،\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL MADFOONO BE-ARZE TOOS. \nPeace be upon you, O you who are buried in the land of Tūs.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَلِيَّ ابْنَ مُوْسَي الرِّضَا وَالتَّحِيَّةُ وَ الثَّنَاۤءُ،\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA A’LIYY IBNE MOOSAR REZAA WAT TAHIYYATO WAS SANAA-O. \nPeace be upon you, O Ali ibn Musa al-Reza, and (upon you be) the greeting and the praise.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ وَ عَلٰي اٰبَاۤئِكَ السَّبْعَةِ وَ اَبْنَاۤئِكَ الْاَرْبَعَةِ،\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA WA A’LAA AABAAA-EKAS SAB-A’TE WA ABNAAA-EKAL ARBA-A’TE. \nPeace be upon you, and upon your seven fathers and your four sons.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ وَ رَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ.\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOH. \nPeace be upon you all, and the Mercy of Allah and His Blessings."
}
